## 7. OPERATIONAL ENGINEERING (S‑7)

### 7.1 Threat Model First, Checklist Second
The Security Baseline (§8) is generated **from** the STRIDE threat model, not applied uniformly.

**Process:**
1. Identify assets and trust boundaries (per module).
2. Run STRIDE per trust boundary.
3. Generate module-specific security checklist from discovered threats.
